# Knob extremes on a kick and a snare: tuned down/up, short/long decays, then a low short snare and a nominal clap.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 4.0
track kick
param p1 0 0
param p2 0 0
note 0 F3 1 127
param p1 255 4
param p2 255 4
note 4 F3 1 127
param p1 60 12
param p2 90 12
note 12 A3 1 127
param p1 128 20
param p2 128 20
note 20 B3 1 127
expect sound 0 24
expect idle 60
expect peak_below 0
